    "Free todz cloud spots are extremely limited. You can always [run your own server](%@).": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Free todz cloud spots are extremely limited. You can always [run your own server](%@)."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "As vagas gratuitas do todz cloud são extremamente limitadas. Você sempre pode [rodar o seu próprio servidor](%@)."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Los cupos gratuitos de todz cloud son extremadamente limitados. Siempre puedes [ejecutar tu propio servidor](%@)."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Die kostenlosen Plätze in todz cloud sind extrem begrenzt. Du kannst jederzeit [deinen eigenen Server betreiben](%@)."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Les places gratuites sur todz cloud sont extrêmement limitées. Vous pouvez toujours [faire tourner votre propre serveur](%@)."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "無料のtodz cloudの枠は非常に限られています。いつでも[独自のサーバを動かせます](%@)。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "무료 todz cloud 자리는 매우 한정되어 있어요. 언제든 [나만의 서버를 운영](%@)할 수 있어요."
          }
        },
        "zh": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "免费的 todz cloud 名额极其有限。你随时可以[运行你自己的服务器](%@)。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
